# W4-SQ: SOV09 played with real orders only (no cheats). The Yuris arrive by
# paradrop plane (Droppod), the player takes them at battle control (65 s),
# pulls them back out of the patrols' way so 'Yuri's are Dead' (armed at
# 100 s) never fires.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov09u.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 600 airborne(6) >= 1
until 2000 campaign_frame >= 980
assert units(6,YURI) >= 2
click unit 6:YURI:0
click cell 36 74
click unit 6:YURI:1
click cell 37 74
# W5-B: with infantry sub-cells the drop lands the two Yuris on spots of one
# cell and the fight timing shifts; the second Yuri later walks back north
# into the patrols (a re-route after it engages). A player re-issues the
# pull-back.
until 600 campaign_frame >= 1150
click unit 6:YURI:0
click cell 36 75
click unit 6:YURI:1
click cell 37 75
until 1500 campaign_frame >= 1600
assert units(6,YURI) >= 1
assert outcome == RUNNING
shot alive
until 1000 campaign_frame >= 2200
assert units(6,YURI) >= 1
assert outcome == RUNNING
dump
cheat camp_log
end
